  journalist dad\, Svein\, on the other hand\, loves his job so much\, he b
 arely notices the festive season. One night\, Mari’s Christmas list vani
 shes – and in its place lies a mysterious mitten. The mitten sends Mari
 \, Svein and her adventurous grandma on an exciting quest to find Santa Cl
 aus. Meanwhile\, Stubby the Wishlist Elf is in a panic — he’s lost his
  mitten\, which might just lead this curious family straight to the secret
  location of Santa’s workshop! He must stop them before it’s too late!
 <br/><br/>The family’s journey takes them through winter wonderlands\, s
 avage snowstorms\, encounters with elves – and an unexpected guardian st
 anding between them and Santa! They set out to find Santa — but along th
 e way discover the real meaning of Christmas.
